+- `Rev(VS) = reverseSlice(VS)`, definitionally equal to
+  `buildVS(VS, vsLen(VS) +Int -1, -1, -1)`;
+- `SumI(VS) = sumInts(0, VS)`;
+- `SumF(VS) = sumToFloat(0, VS)`.
+
+`spec.k` proves:
